        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin CRD, Baldwin Reserve Collection Contemporary Round Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Round Deadbolt has that clean, simple look that is so popular in modern home decor. It is available in beautiful finishes including satin nickel, polished chrome, and venetian bronze finishes, all of which are back by a 25 year finish warranty. It is easy to install and comes with an adjustable latch suitable for 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. A grade 2 deadbolt, it has a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Round Rose Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin 5 pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Single Cylinder: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Double Cylinder: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn on the interior and a key from the exterior</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a key from both the interior and the exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Contemporary-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354513\" width=\"600\" height=\"124\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
